{"id":"c7d107c2c14774de","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system.md","title":"模式高阶重写系统","display":"df-higher-order-rewrite-system — 模式高阶重写系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-higher-order-terms]]","[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","[[56-df-lambda-term]]"],"display":"df-higher-order-rewrite-system — 模式高阶重写系统","label":"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system","aliases":["56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system"],"type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.18,11.2.21,11.2.23,11.2.25, printed pp596–598","source_ocr_block":"617–619","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f6999282aa3dc01\" href=\"?note=5f6999282aa3dc01\" title=\"56-df-higher-order-terms\">56-df-higher-order-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-higher-order-rewrite-system — 模式高阶重写系统"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.18,11.2.21,11.2.23,11.2.25, printed pp596–598"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"617–619"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定非空带类型签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,\\tau_F)\">\\((F,\\tau_F)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_A,H,H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\nu_A,\\bar h\">\\(H_A,H,H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\nu_A,\\bar h\\)</span>、出现路径、绑定集合与最大应用脊见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5f6999282aa3dc01\" href=\"?note=5f6999282aa3dc01\" title=\"56-df-higher-order-terms\">56-df-higher-order-terms</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_A\">\\(\\simeq_A\\)</span> 是其中明确引用的固定类型 βη 转换。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\">\\(L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为集合参数，Pattern 使用同一个原始代表元计算所有出现路径。商上应用、抽象及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).l\">\\(\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).l\\)</span> 表示按列表次序的嵌套商上抽象，空列表时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\">\\(l\\)</span>；连续应用左结合，空应用列表时为头本身。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为集合参数，以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_R\">\\(I_R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_H\">\\(\\to_H\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{HRule}\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathrm{HRule}\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是关系参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Pattern}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;M\\in H\\land\n\\exists M_0\\in\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\Bigl(\n[M_0]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}=M\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall p\\in W_\\lambda\\;\\forall h\\in V\\cup F\\;\n\\forall(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L_0^k\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Spine}(M_0,p,h,(N_1,\\ldots,N_k))\\land h\\in\\mathrm{FV}(M_0)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_k)\\in\\mathrm{Bind}(M_0,p)^k\\;\n\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^k\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n\\bigl(y_i\\in V_{A_i}\\land[N_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\in\\Lambda_{A_i}\n\\land[N_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\simeq_{A_i}[y_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow y_i\\ne y_j)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Pattern}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;M\\in H\\land\n\\exists M_0\\in\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\Bigl(\n[M_0]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}=M\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall p\\in W_\\lambda\\;\\forall h\\in V\\cup F\\;\n\\forall(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L_0^k\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Spine}(M_0,p,h,(N_1,\\ldots,N_k))\\land h\\in\\mathrm{FV}(M_0)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_k)\\in\\mathrm{Bind}(M_0,p)^k\\;\n\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^k\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n\\bigl(y_i\\in V_{A_i}\\land[N_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\in\\Lambda_{A_i}\n\\land[N_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\simeq_{A_i}[y_i]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow y_i\\ne y_j)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HRule}\\coloneqq\\{(L,U)\\in H^2:{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(z_1,\\ldots,z_n)\\in V^n\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^n\\;\n\\exists l,r\\in H_b\\;\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in H^k\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;L=\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).l\\land U=\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).r\\land l=\\bar f u_1\\cdots u_k\n\\land\\mathrm{Pattern}(l)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}(l)=\\{z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}(r)\\subseteq\\{z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(z_i\\in V_{A_i})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow z_i\\ne z_j)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HRule}\\coloneqq\\{(L,U)\\in H^2:{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(z_1,\\ldots,z_n)\\in V^n\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^n\\;\n\\exists l,r\\in H_b\\;\\exists f\\in F\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in H^k\\;\\bigl(\\\\\n&amp;L=\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).l\\land U=\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).r\\land l=\\bar f u_1\\cdots u_k\n\\land\\mathrm{Pattern}(l)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}(l)=\\{z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}(r)\\subseteq\\{z_1,\\ldots,z_n\\}\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(z_i\\in V_{A_i})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(i\\ne j\\Longrightarrow z_i\\ne z_j)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HRS}(F,\\tau_F,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\nF\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\tau_F\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^{F}\\land R\\subseteq\\mathrm{HRule}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HRS}(F,\\tau_F,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\nF\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\tau_F\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^{F}\\land R\\subseteq\\mathrm{HRule}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nI_R\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in H^2:{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^n\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists(L,U)\\in R\\cap H_{A_1\\Rightarrow\\cdots\\Rightarrow A_n\\Rightarrow b}^{2}\\;\n\\exists(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{n}H_{A_i}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(s=\\nu_b(Ls_1\\cdots s_n)\\land t=\\nu_b(Us_1\\cdots s_n)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nI_R\\coloneqq\\{(s,t)\\in H^2:{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\n\\exists(A_1,\\ldots,A_n)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^n\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists(L,U)\\in R\\cap H_{A_1\\Rightarrow\\cdots\\Rightarrow A_n\\Rightarrow b}^{2}\\;\n\\exists(s_1,\\ldots,s_n)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{n}H_{A_i}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(s=\\nu_b(Ls_1\\cdots s_n)\\land t=\\nu_b(Us_1\\cdots s_n)\\bigr)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HCompat}(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;Q\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\;\\forall(s,t)\\in Q\\cap H_B^2\\;\n\\forall x\\in V_A\\;((\\lambda x.s,\\lambda x.t)\\in Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n\\forall\\vec u,\\vec v\\in H^k\\;\\forall h\\in V\\cup F\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\bar h u_1\\cdots u_k\\in H_b\\land\\bar h v_1\\cdots v_k\\in H_b\n\\land(u_j,v_j)\\in Q\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\setminus\\{j\\}\\;(u_i=v_i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\bar h u_1\\cdots u_k,\\bar h v_1\\cdots v_k)\\in Q\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HCompat}(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;Q\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^2\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\;\\forall(s,t)\\in Q\\cap H_B^2\\;\n\\forall x\\in V_A\\;((\\lambda x.s,\\lambda x.t)\\in Q)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\n\\forall\\vec u,\\vec v\\in H^k\\;\\forall h\\in V\\cup F\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\bar h u_1\\cdots u_k\\in H_b\\land\\bar h v_1\\cdots v_k\\in H_b\n\\land(u_j,v_j)\\in Q\\land\n\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\setminus\\{j\\}\\;(u_i=v_i)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\bar h u_1\\cdots u_k,\\bar h v_1\\cdots v_k)\\in Q\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_H\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{Q\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^2:\n\\mathrm{HCompat}(Q)\\land I_R\\subseteq Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_H\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{Q\\subseteq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A^2:\n\\mathrm{HCompat}(Q)\\land I_R\\subseteq Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件 Definitions 11.2.18、11.2.21、11.2.23、11.2.25 的定位。自由变量仅能作用于彼此不同、在该位置绑定的变量，参数允许其同类型 η 长展开；这正是模式条件中的固定类型转换。选定代表元的所有绑定变量可分离改名，因此有限原始项上的检查不依赖额外命名约定。</p>\n<p>规则外层按同一列表抽象全部左部自由变量，右部不引入新自由变量；两端因而具有同一个箭头类型。实例列表的类型已由笛卡儿积绑定，所以送入 ν 的两项均处于其基本类型定义域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_R\">\\(I_R\\)</span> 中每对项同类型，抽象与头应用也保持相应类型，因此全体同类型项对是相容闭包的一个候选；关系族非空，交构造良定义。βη 规范化属于元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_H\">\\(\\to_H\\)</span> 为对象规则的归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-higher-order-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5f6999282aa3dc01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor